---
name: kbd
type: registry:ui
title: Kbd
description: Used to display textual user input from keyboard.
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/kbd/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/kbd/index.ts"
  - path: registry/items/components/kbd/kbd.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/kbd/kbd.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/kbd/kbd-group.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/kbd/kbd-group.svelte"
---

Use kbd to show keyboard shortcuts. Compose keys with `Kbd.Group` and nest `Kbd.Root` for each key.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import * as Kbd from '~/components/kbd';
</script>

<Kbd.Group>
	<Kbd.Root>Ctrl</Kbd.Root>
	<span>+</span>
	<Kbd.Root>B</Kbd.Root>
</Kbd.Group>
```
